/50\"></div><div class=\"absolute top-20 left-10 w-80 h-80 bg-gold/5 rounded-full blur-3xl\"></div><div class=\"absolute bottom-10 right-10 w-96 h-96 bg-red-500/10 rounded-full blur-3xl\"></div><div class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-32 md:py-44 relative z-10\"><div class=\"text-center\"><div class=\"flex justify-center mb-8\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-4\"><div class=\"h-px w-16 bg-gradient-to-r from-transparent to-gold/50\"></div><span class=\"seal-tag-gold !text-gold !border-gold/40 text-xs\">千年传承</span><div class=\"h-px w-16 bg-gradient-to-l from-transparent to-gold/50\"></div></div></div><h1 class=\"text-6xl md:text-8xl font-bold mb-6 tracking-wide\"><span class=\"text-gradient-gold\">命理网</span></h1><p class=\"text-2xl md:text-3xl text-red-100 mb-6 font-kai tracking-widest\">传承千年智慧 · 解读命运密码</p><p class=\"text-lg text-red-200/80 mb-12 max-w-2xl mx-auto leading-relaxed\">融合四柱八字、紫微斗数、奇门遁甲、梅花易数四大传统命理体系， 为您提供专业精准的命理分析服务</p><div class=\"flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-5 justify-center\"><a class=\"btn-secondary text-lg px-12 py-4\" href=\"/bazi\">开始排盘</a><a class=\"px-12 py-4 text-lg font-semibold rounded-[12px] border-2 border-white/30 text-white hover:bg-white/10 hover:border-white/50 transition-all\" href=\"/membership\">开通会员</a></div><div class=\"mt-20 flex justify-center gap-10 md:gap-20\"><div class=\"text-center\"><div class=\"text-4xl font-bold text-gradient-gold\">4大</div><div class=\"text-sm text-red-200/60 mt-2\">命理体系</div></div><div class=\"text-center\"><div class=\"text-4xl font-bold text-gradient-gold\">50万+</div><div class=\"text-sm text-red-200/60 mt-2\">排盘数据</div></div><div class=\"text-center\"><div class=\"text-4xl font-bold text-gradient-gold\">99.9%</div><div class=\"text-sm text-red-200/60 mt-2\">计算精度</div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"absolute bottom-0 left-0 right-0\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 1440 60\" class=\"w-full h-12 fill-[#F7F2E8]\"><path d=\"M0,32L60,32C120,32,240,32,360,37.3C480,43,600,53,720,53.3C840,53,960,43,1080,37.3C1200,32,1320,32,1380,32L1440,32L1440,60L0,60Z\"></path></svg></div></section><section class=\"py-28 relative\"><div class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8\"><div class=\"text-center mb-20\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-center gap-4 mb-4\"><div class=\"h-px w-10 bg-gold/40\"></div><span class=\"text-gold text-sm font-medium tracking-widest uppercase\">SERVICES</span><div class=\"h-px w-10 bg-gold/40\"></div></div><h2 class=\"text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4\">命理服务</h2><p class=\"text-gray-500 text-lg\">四大传统命理体系，全方位解读人生</p></div><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-8\"><a class=\"group relative card card-hover overflow-hidden\" style=\"animation-delay:0ms\" href=\"/bazi\"><div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-br from-red-50 to-orange-50 opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity duration-500\"></div><div class=\"relative z-10\"><div class=\"w-16 h-16 rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-br from-red-600 to-red-800 flex items-center justify-center text-3xl text-white mb-5 shadow-lg group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform duration-300\">☰</div><h3 class=\"text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2 group-hover:text-red-700 transition-colors\">四柱八字</h3><p class=\"text-sm text-gray-400 mb-4 tracking-wider uppercase\">Four Pillars of Destiny</p><p class=\"text-gray-600 leading-relaxed mb-5\">根据出生年月日时，推算天干地支，分析五行旺衰，解读命运密码</p><div class=\"flex flex-wrap gap-2 mb-5\"><span class=\"px-3 py-1 text-xs bg-gray-50 text-gray-600 rounded-md border border-gray-100\">四柱排盘</span><span class=\"px-3 py-1 text-xs bg-gray-50 text-gray-600 rounded-md border border-gray-100\">大运流年</span><span class=\"px-3 py-1 text-xs bg-gray-50 text-gray-600 rounded-md border border-gray-100\">格局分析</span><span class=\"px-3 py-1 text-xs bg-gray-50 text-gray-600 rounded-md border border-gray-100\">用神取法</span></div><div class=\"flex items-center text-red-700 font-medium text-sm group-hover:gap-2 transition-all\">立即体验<svg class=\"w-4 h-4 ml-1 group-hover:translate-x-1 transition-transform\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" d=\"M17 8l4 4m0 0l-4 4m4-4H3\"></path></svg></div></div></a><a class=\"group relative card card-hover overflow-hidden\" style=\"animation-delay:100ms\" href=\"/ziwei\"><div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-br from-purple-50 to-indigo-50 opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity duration-500\"></div><div class=\"relative z-10\"><div class=\"w-16 h-16 rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-br from-purple-600 to-indigo-700 flex items-center justify-center text-3xl text-white mb-5 shadow-lg group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform duration-300\">★</div><h3 class=\"text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2 group-hover:text-red-700 transition-colors\">紫微斗数</h3><p class=\"text-sm text-gray-400 mb-4 tracking-wider uppercase\">Zi Wei Dou Shu</p><p class=\"text-gray-600 leading-relaxed mb-5\">排列十二宫位星曜，揭示人生各方面运势走向</p><div class=\"flex flex-wrap gap-2 mb-5\"><span class=\"px-3 py-1 text-xs bg-gray-50 text-gray-600 rounded-md border border-gray-100\">十二宫位</span><span class=\"px-3 py-1 text-xs bg-gray-50 text-gray-600 rounded-md border border-gray-100\">十四主星</span><span class=\"px-3 py-1 text-xs bg-gray-50 text-gray-600 rounded-md border border-gray-100\">四化飞星</span><span class=\"px-3 py-1 text-xs bg-gray-50 text-gray-600 rounded-md border border-gray-100\">大限运势</span></div><div class=\"flex items-center text-red-700 font-medium text-sm group-hover:gap-2 transition-all\">立即体验<svg class=\"w-4 h-4 ml-1 group-hover:translate-x-1 transition-transform\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" d=\"M17 8l4 4m0 0l-4 4m4-4H3\"></path></svg></div></div></a><a class=\"group relative card card-hover overflow-hidden\" style=\"animation-delay:200ms\" href=\"/qimen\"><div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-br from-blue-50 to-cyan-50 opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity duration-500\"></div><div class=\"relative z-10\"><div class=\"w-16 h-16 rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-br from-blue-600 to-cyan-700 flex items-center justify-center text-3xl text-white mb-5 shadow-lg group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform duration-300\">◈</div><h3 class=\"text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2 group-hover:text-red-700 transition-colors\">奇门遁甲</h3><p class=\"text-sm text-gray-400 mb-4 tracking-wider uppercase\">Qi Men Dun Jia</p><p class=\"text-gray-600 leading-relaxed mb-5\">古之帝王之术，预测决策、趋吉避凶</p><div class=\"flex flex-wrap gap-2 mb-5\"><span class=\"px-3 py-1 text-xs bg-gray-50 text-gray-600 rounded-md border border-gray-100\">天地人神</span><span class=\"px-3 py-1 text-xs bg-gray-50 text-gray-600 rounded-md border border-gray-100\">三奇六仪</span><span class=\"px-3 py-1 text-xs bg-gray-50 text-gray-600 rounded-md border border-gray-100\">十干克应</span><span class=\"px-3 py-1 text-xs bg-gray-50 text-gray-600 rounded-md border border-gray-100\">用神分析</span></div><div class=\"flex items-center text-red-700 font-medium text-sm group-hover:gap-2 transition-all\">立即体验<svg class=\"w-4 h-4 ml-1 group-hover:translate-x-1 transition-transform\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" d=\"M17 8l4 4m0 0l-4 4m4-4H3\"></path></svg></div></div></a><a class=\"group relative card card-hover overflow-hidden\" style=\"animation-delay:300ms\" href=\"/meihua\"><div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-br from-pink-50 to-rose-50 opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity duration-500\"></div><div class=\"relative z-10\"><div class=\"w-16 h-16 rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-br from-pink-600 to-rose-700 flex items-center justify-center text-3xl text-white mb-5 shadow-lg group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform duration-300\">✿</div><h3 class=\"text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2 group-hover:text-red-700 transition-colors\">梅花易数</h3><p class=\"text-sm text-gray-400 mb-4 tracking-wider uppercase\">Mei Hua Yi Shu</p><p class=\"text-gray-600 leading-relaxed mb-5\">以数起卦，以象断事，简洁精准的占卜之术</p><div class=\"flex flex-wrap gap-2 mb-5\"><span class=\"px-3 py-1 text-xs bg-gray-50 text-gray-600 rounded-md border border-gray-100\">六种起卦</span><span class=\"px-3 py-1 text-xs bg-gray-50 text-gray-600 rounded-md border border-gray-100\">体用分析</span><span class=\"px-3 py-1 text-xs bg-gray-50 text-gray-600 rounded-md border border-gray-100\">卦象演变</span><span class=\"px-3 py-1 text-xs bg-gray-50 text-gray-600 rounded-md border border-gray-100\">应期推断</span></div><div class=\"flex items-center text-red-700 font-medium text-sm group-hover:gap-2 transition-all\">立即体验<svg class=\"w-4 h-4 ml-1 group-hover:translate-x-1 transition-transform\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" d=\"M17 8l4 4m0 0l-4 4m4-4H3\"></path></svg></div></div></a></div></div></section><section class=\"py-28 bg-gradient-to-b from-white to-parchment-50\"><div class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8\"><div class=\"text-center mb-20\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-center gap-4 mb-4\"><div class=\"h-px w-10 bg-gold/40\"></div><span class=\"text-gold text-sm font-medium tracking-widest uppercase\">FEATURES</span><div class=\"h-px w-10 bg-gold/40\"></div></div><h2 class=\"text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4\">为什么选择我们</h2><p class=\"text-gray-500 text-lg\">专业、深度、安全、便捷的命理服务平台</p></div><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-8\"><div class=\"card hover:shadow-lg transition-shadow duration-300 group\"><div class=\"flex items-start gap-5\"><div class=\"w-14 h-14 bg-red-50 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform\"><svg class=\"w-7 h-7 text-red-600\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" d=\"M4 19.5A2.5 2.5 0 0 1 6.5 17H20\"></path></svg></div><div class=\"flex-1 min-w-0\"><h3 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2\">传承经典</h3><p class=\"text-gray-500 leading-relaxed\">严格遵循《三命通会》《紫微斗数全书》等传统命理典籍，算法经过多位命理师验证</p></div></div></div><div class=\"card hover:shadow-lg transition-shadow duration-300 group\"><div class=\"flex items-start gap-5\"><div class=\"w-14 h-14 bg-purple-50 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform\"><svg class=\"w-7 h-7 text-purple-600\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" d=\"M9 12h6m-6 4h6m2 5H7a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h5.586a1 1 0 0 1 .707.293l5.414 5.414a1 1 0 0 1 .293.707V19a2 2 0 0 1-2 2z\"></path></svg></div><div class=\"flex-1 min-w-0\"><h3 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2\">深度解读</h3><p class=\"text-gray-500 leading-relaxed\">不止排盘，更有格局分析、大运流年、分领域断语等深度命理解读</p></div></div></div><div class=\"card hover:shadow-lg transition-shadow duration-300 group\"><div class=\"flex items-start gap-5\"><div class=\"w-14 h-14 bg-green-50 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform\"><svg class=\"w-7 h-7 text-green-600\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" d=\"M12 15v2m-6 4h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2v-6a2 2 0 0 0-2-2H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v6a2 2 0 0 0 2 2zm10-10V7a4 4 0 0 0-8 0v4h8z\"></path></svg></div><div class=\"flex-1 min-w-0\"><h3 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2\">隐私保护</h3><p class=\"text-gray-500 leading-relaxed\">您的个人信息和排盘记录严格保密，数据加密存储，安全有保障</p></div></div></div><div class=\"card hover:shadow-lg transition-shadow duration-300 group\"><div class=\"flex items-start gap-5\"><div class=\"w-14 h-14 bg-orange-50 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform\"><svg class=\"w-7 h-7 text-orange-600\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" d=\"M13 10V3L4 14h7v7l9-11h-7z\"></path></svg></div><div class=\"flex-1 min-w-0\"><h3 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2\">即时计算</h3><p class=\"text-gray-500 leading-relaxed\">先进计算引擎，毫秒级排盘响应，即时获取完整命理分析结果</p></div></div></div><div class=\"card hover:shadow-lg transition-shadow duration-300 group\"><div class=\"flex items-start gap-5\"><div class=\"w-14 h-14 bg-blue-50 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform\"><svg class=\"w-7 h-7 text-blue-600\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" d=\"M9 17v-2m3 2v-4m3 4v-6m2 10H7a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h5.586a1 1 0 0 1 .707.293l5.414 5.414a1 1 0 0 1 .293.707V19a2 2 0 0 1-2 2z\"></path></svg></div><div class=\"flex-1 min-w-0\"><h3 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2\">专业报告</h3><p class=\"text-gray-500 leading-relaxed\">可导出精美PDF命理报告，含完整排盘数据和深度解读分析</p></div></div></div><div class=\"card hover:shadow-lg transition-shadow duration-300 group\"><div class=\"flex items-start gap-5\"><div class=\"w-14 h-14 bg-teal-50 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform\"><svg class=\"w-7 h-7 text-teal-600\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" d=\"M12 18h.01M8 21h8a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V5a2 2 0 0 0-2-2H8a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v14a2 2 0 0 0 2 2z\"></path></svg></div><div class=\"flex-1 min-w-0\"><h3 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2\">多端适配</h3><p class=\"text-gray-500 leading-relaxed\">完美适配手机、平板、电脑，随时随地查看您的命理分析</p></div></div></div></div></div></section><section class=\"py-28 relative overflow-hidden\"><div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-r from-red-900 via-red-800 to-red-900\"></div><div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-hero-pattern opacity-10\"></div><div class=\"absolute top-0 left-0 right-0 h-px bg-gradient-to-r from-transparent via-gold/40 to-transparent\"></div><div class=\"absolute bottom-0 left-0 right-0 h-px bg-gradient-to-r from-transparent via-gold/40 to-transparent\"></div><div class=\"max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 text-center relative z-10 text-white\"><span class=\"seal-tag-gold !text-gold !border-gold/40 mb-6 inline-flex\">会员尊享</span><h2 class=\"text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold mb-4 mt-4\">开通会员，解锁全部功能</h2><p class=\"text-red-200/80 mb-10 text-lg leading-relaxed\">无限次排盘 · 详细命理解读 · 大运流年分析 · 专属报告导出</p><div class=\"flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-4 mb-10\"><span class=\"px-5 py-2 bg-white/10 rounded-full text-sm border border-white/20 backdrop-blur-sm\">✓ <!-- -->无限排盘</span><span class=\"px-5 py-2 bg-white/10 rounded-full text-sm border border-white/20 backdrop-blur-sm\">✓ <!-- -->深度解读</span><span class=\"px-5 py-2 bg-white/10 rounded-full text-sm border border-white/20 backdrop-blur-sm\">✓ <!-- -->PDF报告</span><span class=\"px-5 py-2 bg-white/10 rounded-full text-sm border border-white/20 backdrop-blur-sm\">✓ <!-- -->历史记录</span><span class=\"px-5 py-2 bg-white/10 rounded-full text-sm border border-white/20 backdrop-blur-sm\">✓ <!-- -->优先客服</span></div><a class=\"btn-secondary text-lg px-12 py-4 inline-flex\" href=\"/membership\">查看会员套餐</a></div></section></div><!--$--><!--/$--></div><script>$RB=[];$RV=function(a){$RT=performance.now();for(var b=0;b<a.length;b+=2){var c=a[b],e=a[b+1];null!==e.parentNode&&e.parentNode.removeChild(e);var f=c.parentNode;if(f){var g=c.previousSibling,h=0;do{if(c&&8===c.nodeType){var d=c.data;if(\"/$\"===d||\"/&\"===d)if(0===h)break;else h--;else\"$\"!==d&&\"$?\"!==d&&\"$~\"!==d&&\"$!\"!==d&&\"&\"!==d||h++}d=c.nextSibling;f.removeChild(c);c=d}while(c);for(;e.firstChild;)f.insertBefore(e.firstChild,c);g.data